epLearning.AI 创始人） (@AndrewYNg)","status":"ok","lastSuccessAt":"2026-11-13T18:47:49.612Z"}],"sectionLabel":"行业动态","reportSummary":"Andrew Ng 宣布创办 AI 教育公司 LearnVector，获 Coursera 1 亿美元投资，旨在将学习从“一对多”转变为“一对一”。LearnVector 将利用 AI 为每位学习者定制学习路径，而非提供无约束的聊天机器人——研究表明后者会损害学习效果。平台将结合 Coursera 的权威课程库，提供准确、可信任的个性化学习体验。","reportEdition":"2026-07-29","reportKind":"daily"},{"id":"https://aihot.news/items/cms4b9e8401zrroepw4fw8oka","title":"德里高等法院裁定 OpenAI 利用 ANI 内容训练 AI 未侵犯版权","topic":"行业","publishedAt":"2026-07-29T00:00:35.003Z","urls":["https://aihot.news/items/cms4b9e8401zrroepw4fw8oka","https://www.ithome.com/0/982/520.htm"],"articles":[{"id":"cms4b9e8401zrroepw4fw8oka","title":"德里高等法院裁定 OpenAI 利用 ANI 内容训练 AI 未侵犯版权","originalTitle":"","summary":"德里高等法院认定 OpenAI 利用亚洲国际新闻（ANI）社的内容训练人工智能不构成侵犯版权。法官 Amit Bansal 认为该行为符合印度《版权法》中研究类“合理使用”例外情形，且 ANI 未能证明 ChatGPT 直接复制其受版权保护内容。法院同时指出，现阶段颁布临时禁令将不利于印度正在开发的 LLM 及大量免费使用 ChatGPT 的用户。","reason":"","url":"https://aihot.news/items/cms4b9e8401zrroepw4fw8oka","originalUrl":"https://www.ithome.com/0/982/520.htm","publishedAt":"2026-07-29T00:00:35.003Z","sourcePublishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":null,"datePrecision":"report","sourceId":"aihot-23t2ho","originalSourceName":"IT之家·人工智能","family":"outlet-115kagi","kind":"media","provider":"aihot","category":null,"sectionLabel":"行业动态","selected":false,"contentMode":"licensed-summary","contentType":"news","translationStatus":"original","evidenceRole":"discovery","rights":{"licenseId":"LicenseRef-AIHOT-Written-Permission","permissionId":"aihot-mojing-written-2026-11-04","provider":"aihot","scope":"text-summary","evidenceUrl":"https://aihot.news/items/cms4b9e8401zrroepw4fw8oka","licenseUrl":"https://aihot.news/terms","checkedAt":"2026-11-13T18:47:49.612Z","attribution":"导读来源：AIHOT；原报道权利归原作者","modified":"保留 AIHOT 原摘要，未二次改写"}}],"familyCount":0,"mergeReasons":[],"selectionReasons":[],"provider":"aihot","sourceStates":[{"id":"aihot-23t2ho","name":"IT之家·人工智能","status":"ok","lastSuccessAt":"2026-11-13T18:47:49.612Z"}],"